    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an era dominated by viral trends, you become the &quot;Internet Judge&quot;\u2014where a few keystrokes can sway public opinion and determine fates. This darkly humorous strategy game lets you experience the absurdity and power of &quot;keyboard justice.&quot; Every judgment you make reshapes this chaotic digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bCore Gameplay:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 \u200b<strong>\u200bSwipe to Judge:\u200b</strong>\u200b Like <i>Reigns</i>, swipe left or right to rule on daily controversies\u2014spark online firestorms with just a few words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 \u200b<strong>\u200bFour-Dimensional Balancing Act:\u200b</strong>\u200b Your choices impact \u200b<strong>\u200bJustice\u200b</strong>\u200b, \u200b<strong>\u200bClout\u200b</strong>\u200b, \u200b<strong>\u200bMorality\u200b</strong>\u200b, and \u200b<strong>\u200bChaos\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014each combo unlocking wildly different social-class endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 \u200b<strong>\u200bButterfly Effect:\u200b</strong>\u200b Side with influencers to gain millions of followers, or expose corruption and face bot armies\u2014every decision backfires in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 \u200b<strong>\u200b21 Endings:\u200b</strong>\u200b From &quot;Troll Overlord&quot; to &quot;Trending King,&quot; from &quot;Digitally Cancelled&quot; to &quot;Whistleblower Awakened&quot;\u2014your keyboard crafts your legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bKey Features:\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>\u2713 50+ surreal cases inspired by real internet dramas<br>\u2713 Dynamic news cycle: Last week\u2019s &quot;heroic verdict&quot; may become next week\u2019s scandal<br>\u2713 Social media simulator: Ride the waves of likes, hate mobs, plot twists, and PR redemption<br>\u2713 Hidden identity system: What happens when doxxers expose <i>your</i> real life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;When the screen goes dark\u2014are you a righteous crusader, or just another cog in the outrage machine?&quot;</i></p>",
